Grease #slow cooker{} insert.

Stir @rice{1 1/2%cups}, @sweetened condensed milk{14%oz}, @whole milk{5%cups}, @cinnamon{1/2%teaspoon}, @vanilla extract{1%teaspoon}, and @?raisins{1/2%cup} together in the slow cooker.

Cook on high for ~{2 1/2%hours}, then give it a stir. Taste a little bit of the rice to see if it is cooked through. If it needs more cook time, check it every ~{30%minutes} until it is done. Add a little more milk or water if it needs more liquid.

Serve warm or chilled. Top with @?grated nutmeg{} if desired.